{"4274980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vocal Horror Stories - Gaja", "steam_appid": 4274980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4746270], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocal Horror Stories</strong> is an episodic, <strong>voice-interactive</strong> psychological horror series set in India. <strong>Each episode tells a short and unique story</strong> where your <strong>voice controls the character’s mental state</strong>. Whatever you speak can  change the environment in a positive or negative way. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VOCAL HORROR STORIES – GAJA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>first episode</strong> of this series, you play as Shivani, a young woman with an <strong>anxiety disorder</strong> from Chennai, India. During the COVID lockdown, she is desperately <strong>investigating her missing mother</strong>, Maya, based on the clues she has. However,  her <strong>elephant-headed companion,</strong> Gaja (elephant in Sanskrit), has offered you some help but at a cost. <strong>Who is he? What is his plan? Did she find her mother in the end?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VOICE INTERACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screaming will intensify the horror</strong>. You will need to <strong>say certain words</strong> into your mic to calm yourself. Additionally, some devices will also respond to your voice. So be mindful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/faac443392b800a78521b58d8b10b7de.poster.avif?t=1786516835\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/faac443392b800a78521b58d8b10b7de.webm?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/faac443392b800a78521b58d8b10b7de.mp4?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE THE CASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have questions. Only your missing mother has the answers. Find her using the <strong>clues inside your apartment</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/3d7cc9c526ecfac65ca1c2418a1f0b07.poster.avif?t=1786516835\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/3d7cc9c526ecfac65ca1c2418a1f0b07.webm?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/3d7cc9c526ecfac65ca1c2418a1f0b07.mp4?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ATMOSPHERIC STORYTELLING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story will not be told directly. Rather, occurrences within Shivani's apartment will let you <strong>connect the dots and deduce the story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/0b085639d6351cd8ba6429fcd9639000.poster.avif?t=1786516835\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/0b085639d6351cd8ba6429fcd9639000.webm?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/0b085639d6351cd8ba6429fcd9639000.mp4?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROOTED IN INDIAN FOLKLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story and its clues draw from <strong>Indian culture and sentiments</strong>, giving you a deeply rooted experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/244c832d956d3e85bfdae7ce1bef97ce.poster.avif?t=1786516835\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/244c832d956d3e85bfdae7ce1bef97ce.webm?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/244c832d956d3e85bfdae7ce1bef97ce.mp4?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DAYLIGHT HORROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashlights! There is no darkness to hide in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich, narrative-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS (retro) film aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game text messages from NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player voice activity tracking</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocal Horror Stories</strong> is an episodic, <strong>voice-interactive</strong> psychological horror series set in India. <strong>Each episode tells a short and unique story</strong> where your <strong>voice controls the character’s mental state</strong>. Whatever you speak can  change the environment in a positive or negative way. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VOCAL HORROR STORIES – GAJA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>first episode</strong> of this series, you play as Shivani, a young woman with an <strong>anxiety disorder</strong> from Chennai, India. During the COVID lockdown, she is desperately <strong>investigating her missing mother</strong>, Maya, based on the clues she has. However,  her <strong>elephant-headed companion,</strong> Gaja (elephant in Sanskrit), has offered you some help but at a cost. <strong>Who is he? What is his plan? Did she find her mother in the end?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VOICE INTERACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screaming will intensify the horror</strong>. You will need to <strong>say certain words</strong> into your mic to calm yourself. Additionally, some devices will also respond to your voice. So be mindful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/faac443392b800a78521b58d8b10b7de.poster.avif?t=1786516835\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/faac443392b800a78521b58d8b10b7de.webm?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/faac443392b800a78521b58d8b10b7de.mp4?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE THE CASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have questions. Only your missing mother has the answers. Find her using the <strong>clues inside your apartment</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/3d7cc9c526ecfac65ca1c2418a1f0b07.poster.avif?t=1786516835\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/3d7cc9c526ecfac65ca1c2418a1f0b07.webm?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4274980/extras/3d7cc9c526ecfac65ca1c2418a1f0b07.mp4?t=1786516835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ATMOSPHERIC STORYTELLING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story wil